    "title": "An hour at the bench is an hour well kept.",
    "html": "<div class=\"joyas-landing wp-block-joyas-hero\">\n<div class=\"jl-hero\">\n<div class=\"jl-hero-inner\">\n\n  <div class=\"jl-hero-center\">\n    <figure class=\"jl-hero-logo\">\n      <img src=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/wp-content\/themes\/joyas-block-theme\/assets\/images\/logo_13joyas.png\" alt=\"13 Joyas\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\">\n    <\/figure>\n    <p class=\"jl-eyebrow\">Handcrafted in Berlin · est. 2013<\/p>\n    <h1>An hour at the bench is an hour <em>well kept.<\/em><\/h1>\n        <p class=\"jl-sub\">A small atelier working sterling and reclaimed silver into objects meant to be kept. Drawn, raised and finished under one roof in Berlin-Neukölln.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"jl-hero-footer\">\n    <div>\n      <p>Berlin, Germany<\/p>\n      <p><strong>52°N 13°E<\/strong><\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <p class=\"jl-scroll-indicator\">Scroll<\/p>\n    <div>\n      <p style=\"text-align:right\">Edition №14<\/p>\n      <p style=\"text-align:right\">Spring · MMXXVI<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group joyas-landing is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-collection jl-section-pad is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-section-head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph jl-section-num\">Selected Works <span class=\"dot\">·<\/span> 01<\/p>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading jl-section-title\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Thirteen quiet objects — <em>rings, cuffs and vessels<\/em>, each made to order, none made twice.<\/h2>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-work-grid is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-work large is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group frame is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/http:\/\/localhost:8090\/wp-content\/themes\/joyas-block-theme\/assets\/images\/gold-bracelet.jpg\" alt=\"Halo Cuff, Brushed\"><\/figure>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph jl-work-label has-xs-font-size\">01 · STERLING<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group caption is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Halo Cuff, Brushed<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph meta has-xs-font-size\"><strong>Sterling 925<\/strong> · No. 014 \/ 30<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-work small is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group frame is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/http:\/\/localhost:8090\/wp-content\/themes\/joyas-block-theme\/assets\/images\/ring-closeup.jpg\" alt=\"Tide Signet\"><\/figure>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph jl-work-label has-xs-font-size\">02 · OXIDISED<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group caption is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Tide Signet<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph meta has-xs-font-size\"><strong>Oxidised silver<\/strong> · Made to order<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-work third is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group frame is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/http:\/\/localhost:8090\/wp-content\/themes\/joyas-block-theme\/assets\/images\/jewelry-display.jpg\" alt=\"Stone Vessel\"><\/figure>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph jl-work-label has-xs-font-size\">03 · ROUGH<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group caption is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Stone Vessel<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph meta has-xs-font-size\"><strong>Raised silver<\/strong> · Single piece<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-work third is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group frame is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/http:\/\/localhost:8090\/wp-content\/themes\/joyas-block-theme\/assets\/images\/craftsman-hands.jpg\" alt=\"Thread Band\"><\/figure>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph jl-work-label has-xs-font-size\">04 · FINE<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group caption is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Thread Band<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph meta has-xs-font-size\"><strong>Fine silver 999<\/strong> · Pair<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-work third is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group frame is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/http:\/\/localhost:8090\/wp-content\/themes\/joyas-block-theme\/assets\/images\/silver-texture.jpg\" alt=\"Anchor Pendant\"><\/figure>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph jl-work-label has-xs-font-size\">05 · MIXED<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group caption is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Anchor Pendant<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph meta has-xs-font-size\"><strong>Silver + brass<\/strong> · Limited<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group joyas-landing is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-story jl-section-pad is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-story-grid is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full jl-story-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/http:\/\/localhost:8090\/wp-content\/themes\/joyas-block-theme\/assets\/images\/craftsman-hands.jpg\" alt=\"Silversmith at work\"><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-story-body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph eyebrow-dark\">The Atelier <span style=\"color:oklch(0.58 0.075 70);margin:0 2px\">·<\/span> 02<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">An hour at the bench is an hour <em>well kept.<\/em><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">13 Joyas was founded in 2013 by silversmith Inés Carrera, who trained in Madrid and Pforzheim before opening a one-bench studio in Berlin-Neukölln. The work is small in scale and slow in pace — sterling, fine silver and the occasional reclaimed pour, raised from sheet or forged from rod.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The number thirteen sets the rhythm: thirteen editions per year, thirteen pieces in each. Nothing leaves the studio without a hallmark and a hand-written card.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-sign is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Inés Carrera, Silversmith<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group joyas-landing is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-process jl-section-pad is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-section-head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph jl-section-num\">The Making <span class=\"dot\">·<\/span> 03<\/p>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading jl-section-title\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Four passes between <em>sketch and stamp.<\/em><\/h2>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-process-row is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-step is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph num\">01 · Draw<\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph glyph\">I<\/p>\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Sketch &amp; intent<\/h4>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A first conversation, a sheet of vellum and graphite. Form is set before metal is touched.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-step is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph num\">02 · Raise<\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph glyph\">II<\/p>\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Anneal &amp; raise<\/h4>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sterling is cut, annealed and raised over stake. The mark of the hammer is left where it belongs.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-step is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph num\">03 · Finish<\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph glyph\">III<\/p>\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">File &amp; polish<\/h4>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Surfaces are read by hand under a single north-facing window — brushed, satin or mirror.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group jl-step is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph num\">04 · Hallmark<\/p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph glyph\">IV<\/p>\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--wp--preset--font-family--heading)\">Stamp &amp; record<\/h4>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Each piece receives the 925 hallmark, an edition number out of thirteen, and a card written in the maker’s hand.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"joyas-landing wp-block-joyas-studio\">\n<div class=\"jl-studio\">\n\n  <div class=\"jl-studio-inner\">\n    <h2>Visit the <em>bench.<\/em><\/h2>\n    <div class=\"jl-studio-cols\">\n      <div class=\"addr\">\n        <h5>Studio<\/h5>\n        <p><strong>Weserstraße 13<\/strong><br>12047 Berlin-Neukölln, Germany<br><br>By appointment, Tues – Fri.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div>\n        <h5>Hours &amp; Notes<\/h5>\n        <p>Open studio first Saturday of every month, 11–16h.nnNew editions are released the 13th of each month — sign up to be notified.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"jl-studio-cta\">\n    <p class=\"label\">Write the studio<\/p>\n    <p class=\"jl-email-link\"><a href=\"http:\/\/192.168.178.178:8090\/mailto:hola@13joyas.de\">hola@13joyas.de<\/a><\/p>\n    <p class=\"label\">+49 30 13 13 0013<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n",
